{"path":"/webflow-agency/","slug":"webflow-agency","kind":"landing","title":"Webflow Agency for B2B Marketing Teams | Legency Media","description":"A Webflow agency for B2B marketing teams: builds your team publishes on without a developer, takeovers of inherited sites, and a monthly report your board can read.","source":"live","stylesheets":["/_astro/global.Btqt_PqA.css","/_astro/Base.D9X9tJbq.css","/_astro/ConsentBanner.Bjqg_HPr.css","/_astro/FaqSection.BU63QfoB.css","/_astro/ServiceLayout.DWPKQstD.css"],"scripts":["/_astro/Nav.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BTi8Y4C0.js","/_astro/Footer.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.QLgbxcz6.js","/_astro/ConsentBanner.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BlWZOVqD.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BUtqXeGZ.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_1_lang.s69FG7Vr.js"],"mainHtml":"<section class=\"svc-hero svc-hero--proof\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"svc-hero__tex\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/secondary-hero.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><div class=\"container svc-hero__inner\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Webflow Agency</span><h1 class=\"svc-hero__title\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Webflow Agency for B2B Marketing Teams</h1><p class=\"svc-hero__sub\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Your website belongs on marketing’s calendar. We take over Webflow builds a departed developer left behind, rebuild them as components your team publishes on, and report every month on what the site earned in search and AI answers.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--blue\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get in touch</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a><p class=\"svc-hero__proof\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Webflow lists Legency Media as a Premium Partner. Our profile describes our Enterprise work. <a href=\"https://webflow.com/@legencymedia\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Verify the partner profile ↗</a></p></div></section><section class=\"section evo\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__head\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Where Marketing Gets Stuck</span><h2 class=\"evo__heading\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Why B2B Marketing Teams Hire a Webflow Agency</h2></div><div class=\"evo__grid\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Problem</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Where Most Teams Start</span></div><div class=\"evo__cards\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9 6L20 6\"/><path d=\"M3.80002 5.79999L4.60002 6.59998L6.60001 4.59999\"/><path d=\"M3.80002 11.8L4.60002 12.6L6.60001 10.6\"/><path d=\"M3.80002 17.8L4.60002 18.6L6.60001 16.6\"/><path d=\"M9 12L20 12\"/><path d=\"M9 18L20 18\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Every page change waits on engineering</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The website sits with a product team that has its own roadmap. A pricing update or a campaign page joins the queue, and by the time it ships the campaign window has closed.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 9L18.005 20.3463C17.8369 21.3026 17.0062 22 16.0353 22H7.96474C6.99379 22 6.1631 21.3026 5.99496 20.3463L4 9\"/><path d=\"M21 6L15.375 6M3 6L8.625 6M8.625 6V4C8.625 2.89543 9.52043 2 10.625 2H13.375C14.4796 2 15.375 2.89543 15.375 4V6M8.625 6L15.375 6\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The developer who built it has left</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The freelancer or in-house developer who understood the build moved on and took that knowledge with them. Nobody left instructions, so every change starts with someone learning the site.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9.00001 21L8.00001 21C6.89544 21 6.00001 20.1057 6.00001 19.0011C6.00001 17.4501 6.00001 15.3443 6 14C6 13 4.5 12 4.5 12C4.5 12 6.00001 11 6.00001 10C6.00001 8.827 6.00001 6.62207 6.00001 4.99914C6.00001 3.89457 6.89544 3 8.00001 3L9.00001 3\"/><path d=\"M15 21L16 21C17.1046 21 18 20.1057 18 19.0011C18 17.4501 18 15.3443 18 14C18 13 19.5 12 19.5 12C19.5 12 18 11 18 10C18 8.827 18 6.62207 18 4.99914C18 3.89457 17.1046 3 16 3L15 3\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The build breaks when anyone touches it</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Pages were hand-built one at a time, each slightly differently. One edit breaks a page nobody was watching, so the team stops touching the site and it drifts away from what the company sells.</p></article></div></div><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Solution</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle evo__coltitle--brand\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><img src=\"/img/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"evo__logo\" width=\"57\" height=\"57\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Legency Approach</span></span></div><div class=\"evo__cards evo__cards--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Marketing publishes pages on its own calendar</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>We rebuild the site as a library of tested components. Your team assembles a landing page, a case study or a pricing change itself, and developer time goes to new sections only.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M1 20V19C1 15.134 4.13401 12 8 12V12C11.866 12 15 15.134 15 19V20\"/><path d=\"M13 14V14C13 11.2386 15.2386 9 18 9V9C20.7614 9 23 11.2386 23 14V14.5\"/><path d=\"M8 12C10.2091 12 12 10.2091 12 8C12 5.79086 10.2091 4 8 4C5.79086 4 4 5.79086 4 8C4 10.2091 5.79086 12 8 12Z\"/><path d=\"M18 9C19.6569 9 21 7.65685 21 6C21 4.34315 19.6569 3 18 3C16.3431 3 15 4.34315 15 6C15 7.65685 16.3431 9 18 9Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>One named team holds the build</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The same people work on your site every month and keep its documentation current. The knowledge stays with the build, so a departure on either side never puts the website back at zero.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9 21H15M9 21V16M9 21H3.6C3.26863 21 3 20.7314 3 20.4V16.6C3 16.2686 3.26863 16 3.6 16H9M15 21V9M15 21H20.4C20.7314 21 21 20.7314 21 20.4V3.6C21 3.26863 20.7314 3 20.4 3H15.6C15.2686 3 15 3.26863 15 3.6V9M15 9H9.6C9.26863 9 9 9.26863 9 9.6V16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>A monthly record your board can read</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Each month closes with what shipped, what it was for and what the site earned in search and AI answers, every number with its source. Our clients forward it to their CEO and board as written.</p></article></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section foundation\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"foundation__head\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>What the Agency Runs</span><h2 class=\"foundation__heading\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>What a Webflow Agency Should Run for Marketing</h2></div></div><div class=\"foundation__grid\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Builds Your Team Can Operate</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>New Webflow sites and rebuilds of inherited ones, structured as components with editor permissions and a publishing process. Marketing adds pages and changes layouts without opening a ticket.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M17 20V4M17 4L20 7M17 4L14 7\"/><path d=\"M7 4V20M7 20L10 17M7 20L4 17\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Migrations That Keep Your Rankings</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Moves from WordPress, Prismic or a hand-coded site with every URL mapped to its new home. The old site stays live until the new one is proven, and rankings are watched through cutover.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M15 4V2M15 4V6M15 4H10.5M3 10V19C3 20.1046 3.89543 21 5 21H19C20.1046 21 21 20.1046 21 19V10H3Z\"/><path d=\"M3 10V6C3 4.89543 3.89543 4 5 4H7\"/><path d=\"M7 2V6\"/><path d=\"M21 10V6C21 4.89543 20.1046 4 19 4H18.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Support on Agreed Turnarounds</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Campaign pages, CMS work and fixes requested in a shared channel, on turnarounds agreed each month. A launch can be planned around the website because the timing is known in advance.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 12V5.74853C20 5.5894 19.9368 5.43679 19.8243 5.32426L16.6757 2.17574C16.5632 2.06321 16.4106 2 16.2515 2H4.6C4.26863 2 4 2.26863 4 2.6V21.4C4 21.7314 4.26863 22 4.6 22H11\"/><path d=\"M8 10H16M8 6H12M8 14H11\"/><path d=\"M20.5 20.5L22 22\"/><path d=\"M15 18C15 19.6569 16.3431 21 18 21C18.8299 21 19.581 20.663 20.1241 20.1185C20.6654 19.5758 21 18.827 21 18C21 16.3431 19.6569 15 18 15C16.3431 15 15 16.3431 15 18Z\"/><path d=\"M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Visibility in Search and AI Answers</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Technical SEO, structured data and buyer-question tracking across ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini and Claude. You see whether your company is named when a prospect asks an AI assistant about your category.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section dp\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r><div class=\"dp__head\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>Choosing a Partner</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>Which Kind of Webflow Partner Fits Your Team</h2><p class=\"dp__sub\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>A search for a Webflow expert, a Webflow developer or a Webflow agency leads to different kinds of partner. Each one fits a different stage of company, and the wrong fit shows up a year after launch.</p></div></div><div class=\"container dp__cards\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r><h3 data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>A freelance Webflow expert</h3><p data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>Fits a small marketing site with one owner and a few changes a month. The risk arrives when they move on, because the build and the knowledge of it leave together.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r><h3 data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>A design studio that builds in Webflow</h3><p data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>Fits a brand-led launch where the visual identity is the main deliverable. Ask who holds the site in month seven, because many studios hand over at launch and move to the next project.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r><h3 data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>A Webflow Enterprise partner</h3><p data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>Fits a company whose site has to pass procurement, serve several markets or report to a board. The work continues after launch as support, migration and measurement under one team.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r><h3 data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>An in-house Webflow developer</h3><p data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>Fits a company with a steady flow of web work and someone to manage the hire. Budget for cover when they are on leave, and for the handover when they leave for good.</p></article></div><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r><p class=\"dp__foot\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>For the full set of questions to put to any shortlist, read our <a href=\"/blog/how-to-choose-a-webflow-enterprise-agency/\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>Webflow Enterprise agency buyer checklist</a>.</p></div></section><section class=\"section dp dp--alt\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r><div class=\"dp__head\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>Client Results</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>Measured Results From Live Client Engagements</h2><p class=\"dp__sub\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>Each figure names its source and its window, so you can repeat it to your own leadership and defend it.</p></div></div><div class=\"container dp__cards\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r><h3 data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>Blueflame AI: organic visits up 77%</h3><p data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>Organic search visits rose from 7,574 to 13,388, comparing September to November 2024 with June to August 2026. Visits from AI assistants rose 58% in January to August 2026 against the same months of 2025.</p><p class=\"dp__link\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r><a href=\"/case-studies/blueflame-ai/\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>Read the Blueflame AI case study</a></p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r><h3 data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>ChannelSight: the most-cited source in AI answers</h3><p data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>Weekly checks across six AI assistants ranked channelsight.com the most-cited source for its buyer questions on 12 October 2026. Structured data now runs on 475 of its 586 pages, up from none in June.</p><p class=\"dp__link\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r><a href=\"/case-studies/channelsight/\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>Read the ChannelSight case study</a></p></article></div></section><section class=\"section dp\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r><div class=\"dp__head\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>Where to Start</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>Two Ways to Start With a Webflow Agency</h2></div></div><div class=\"container dp__cards\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r><h3 data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>You need a new site or a rebuild</h3><p data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>The current site cannot carry the next stage of the company, or it lives on a platform marketing cannot change. We scope the component system, the migration and the publishing process before anything is designed.</p><p class=\"dp__link\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r><a href=\"/services/webflow-enterprise/\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>How an enterprise Webflow build works</a></p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r><h3 data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>Your Webflow site is live and stuck</h3><p data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>The site works, but changes queue behind engineering or the person who built it has gone. We review the build, take it over and run it on a monthly retainer with agreed turnarounds.</p><p class=\"dp__link\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r><a href=\"/services/webflow-support/\" data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r>How Webflow support and maintenance works</a></p></article></div></section><section class=\"caseband\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"pixelated-scroll-transition\" data-pixelated-scroll-transition data-columns=\"24\" data-columns-tablet=\"18\" data-columns-mobile=\"10\" data-rows=\"8\" data-mode=\"reveal\" style=\"color:var(--bg)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"caseband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div><div class=\"container caseband__inner\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"caseband__content\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Case Study</span><span class=\"caseband__chip\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/partners/k2-group.svg\" alt=\"K2 Group\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></span><h2 class=\"caseband__heading\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Six websites in six languages, run as one estate.</h2><p class=\"caseband__text\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>K2 Group runs six websites across six languages. We hold the builds, the search programme and a monthly report that goes to the board. Search impressions across five of the sites rose 42% between May and September 2026.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/case-studies/k2-group/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>View Case Study</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div><div class=\"caseband__media\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/covers/case-k2-group.jpg\" alt=\"A harbour at night with moored boats, rendered as a blue pixel dither, captioned Six sites, one answer\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div></div></section><section class=\"ctaband\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz></div><div class=\"container ctaband__inner\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__text\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Start With a Build Review</span><h2 class=\"ctaband__heading\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>A Review of Your Current Webflow Build</h2><p class=\"ctaband__body\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>A call with the person who would run your site. We look at how the build is structured, who can change it today and what that costs you in missed launches, then say whether a rebuild, a support retainer or neither fits.</p></div><div class=\"ctaband__side\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><ul class=\"ctaband__points\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Whether the current build can be supported as it stands</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>What your team could publish without a developer</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>How results would be reported to your leadership</li></ul><div class=\"ctaband__actions\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get in touch</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a><a class=\"ctaband__quiet\" href=\"/services/webflow-support/\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>How ongoing Webflow support works</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section faq\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__head\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Common Questions</span><h2 class=\"faq__heading\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Frequently Asked<br data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Questions</h2></div><div class=\"faq__list\" data-faq data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-0\" id=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>What is a Webflow agency?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-0\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>A Webflow agency designs, builds and runs websites on Webflow, the visual website platform. For a B2B marketing team that usually means the build or rebuild, a migration from another platform, a component system the team can publish on, and support once the site is live.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-1\" id=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Which Webflow agency is considered the best?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>The best Webflow agency is the one whose evidence matches your situation. Check partner status in Webflow’s own directory. Ask to watch someone on the client side publish a page. Ask for a measured result with its source and date. Webflow lists Legency Media as a Premium Partner with Enterprise work, focused on B2B marketing teams.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-2\" id=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Should we hire a Webflow expert or a Webflow agency?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>A freelance Webflow expert suits a small site with one owner and a few changes a month. An agency suits a site that carries pipeline, has several people publishing, or has to pass procurement. The deciding question is who holds the build when one person leaves.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-3\" id=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Can you take over a Webflow site another developer built?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Yes, after a review. We look at how the build is structured first, because a site with a tangled style system costs more to change, and you should know that before signing. If it needs repair before it can be supported, that is scoped separately and you see the scope in writing.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-4\" id=\"faq-btn-4\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>How much does a Webflow agency cost?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-4\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-4\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>It depends on scope. A build or migration is quoted as a fixed project, and support runs as a monthly retainer with agreed turnarounds. Webflow bills its own platform plans directly, so ask any agency to show its fee and the Webflow plan as separate lines.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-5\" id=\"faq-btn-5\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>What does a Webflow development agency do after launch?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-5\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-5\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>On a retainer it builds campaign pages, keeps the component system clean, checks forms and integrations, and reports each month on what shipped and what the site earned in search and AI answers. Without one, the build usually drifts until a rebuild quote arrives.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>","inlineStyles":[".transition {\n          display: none;\n        }",".dp__heading[data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r]{font-size:var(--h4);margin-bottom:var(--sp-3);max-width:24ch}.dp__sub[data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r]{font-size:var(--para-sm);max-width:56ch;margin-bottom:var(--sp-2)}.dp__head[data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r]{margin-bottom:var(--sp-4);max-width:64ch}.dp--alt[data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r]{background:var(--white)}.dp__cards[data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r]{gap:var(--sp-3);grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));display:grid}.dp__card[data-astro-cid-jsaytz4r]{background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:va